{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28099","headline":"和刘补阙秋园寓兴六首 六 · 雍陶","name":"和刘补阙秋园寓兴六首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣代少封事，闲居方屏喧。\n漏寒云外阙，木落月中园。\n山鸟宿檐树，水萤流洞门。\n无人见清景，林下自开尊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28099.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28099","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}